1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:05,920
You pay 12 million VND upfront for annual insurance, yet only 1 million becomes earned revenue in Month 1.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:14,560
Step one: all 12 million lands in the collecting bank while corporate buyers park it in Account 242 prepaid expense.

3
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:22,490
Step two: across 1,000 policies totaling 12 billion VND, 3 billion exits early for commissions and underwriting.

4
00:00:23,070 --> 00:00:30,730
Step three: only one-twelfth unlocks each month into earned revenue while 11 million stays locked as an unearned liability.

5
00:00:31,310 --> 00:00:40,690
Step four: 8 billion VND flows into Account 128 government bonds and term deposits, earning 480 million in annual interest.

6
00:00:41,270 --> 00:00:49,230
Step five: even if 9 billion in claims plus 3 billion in expenses hits 100%, bond yield on float keeps the insurer positive.
